            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "If? (اگر, agar.) But? (ولی, vali.) Because of? (به خاطر, be khâter-e.) A result? (نتیجه, natije.) A problem? (مشکل, moshkel.) Anyway? (به هر حال, be har hâl.) Without? (بدون, bedun-e.) Otherwise? (وگرنه, vagarna.) While? (در حالی که, dar hâli ke.) Especially? (مخصوصا, makhsusan.) A motive? (انگیزه, angize.) A meaning? (منظور, manzur.) An intention? (قصد, qasd.) An event? (اتفاق, ettefâq.) Luck? (شانس, shâns.) Tasty? (خوشمزه, khoshmaze.) Cool? (خنک, khonak.) Raw? (خام, khâm.) Tight? (تنگ, tang.) Loose? (گشاد, goshâd.)"
            }
